  "name": "Mystical Connection",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You now have the ability to nudge which spirits of Spirits from Beyond you channel. Whenever you roll on the Spirits from Beyond table, you can roll the die twice and choose which of the two effects to bestow. If you roll the same number on both dice, you can ignore the number and choose any effect on the table.</p>",
